# Shell scripts must keep LF on every checkout.
#
# This project is Windows-only, and Windows users get core.autocrlf=true by
# default, so a cloned setup.sh arrives with CRLF line endings and `bash setup.sh`
# fails on the first line with "$'\r': command not found" - the one script whose
# whole job is to make the install painless.
*.sh text eol=lf
